{'symbol': 'KIM', 'date': '2021-04-30 23:31:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION OF KIMCO REALTY CORP. - KIM', 'text': 'NEW YORK, APRIL 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JUAN MONTEVERDE , FOUNDER AND MANAGING PARTNER AT MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC, A NATIONAL SECURITIES FIRM RATED\xa0TOP 50\xa0IN THE 2018-2020 ISS SECURITIES CLASS ACTION SERVICES REPORT AND HEADQUARTERED AT THE\xa0EMPIRE STATE BUILDING\xa0IN NEW YORK CITY, IS INVESTIGATING\xa0KIMCO REALTY CORP. ("KIM" OR THE "COMPANY") ( KIM )\xa0RELATING TO ITS PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF WEINGARTEN REALTY INVESTORS (WRI). UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, WRI SHAREHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE 1.408 SHARES OF KIMCO AND $2.89 IN CASH PER SHARE.'}